engine-batch55: the four-leg engine of HPC/Fold/Leg4.lean, with the two floor
announcements read at P-3 and P-4 (which is what they are when M = P-2), swept over
every parameter set L=0, H=9, L+2 <= P <= L+6, L+1 <= M <= P-2, M+3 <= K <= H-1,
H <= K+3, P <= K.  For each set: the arms of the corpus based within two of P that
satisfy the three announcements, the steps at which the greedy leaves Val4, the arms
that do not fold onto the walk at all, and the invariant of gseq4_inv.

